<title>ST VINCENT AND THE GRENADINES: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT INDIA IN 3RD ONE-DAYER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT INDIA IN 3RD ONE-DAYER.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat India by 18 runs in the third one-day international at Arnos Vale on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 249-9 (50 overs), India 231 all out (48.2).</p>
<p>West Indies lead four-match series 2-1.</p>
